# armour/tiles/scale: scale units over the scale (and mail-finer) sleeve region (U): 3 px units, the top row keeps its drawn
# step and the unit's lower edge falls a step, the courses offset, so the upper arm reads as the body's scale (STYLE_P2 25.2).
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h; `on-region` is P2C_CONTRACTS 4.
use person
body adult
role overlay scale
tags tile overlay
on-region U

view D key rest origin 0 0
|xxwxxw
|xwwxww
|wxxwxx
|wxwwxw
